\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 A Trump-Vance administration would be \u8216\'20\'18the most dangerous\u8217\'20\'19 for  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights, say advocates\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 996 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2024\par 12:28 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Rights groups are vociferously condemning Trump\u8217\'20\'19s VP pick of JD Vance, who has long opposed the procedure\par \par \uc2 Within minutes of \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement that he had tapped Ohio senator JD Vance as his running mate in the 2024 elections, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights groups vociferously condemned the pick.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA Trump-Vance administration will be the most dangerous administration for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and reproductive freedom in this country\u8217\'20\'19s history,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Mini Timmaraju\uc2 , president and CEO of \uc2 Reproductive Freedom for All\uc2 , said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBy naming Vance to his ticket, Trump made clear that his administration will sign a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban and put birth control and IVF at risk,\u8221\'20\'1D said Jessica Mackler, president of Emily\u8217\'20\'19s List, an organization that supports Democratic women who support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights running for office.\par \par \uc2 Vance, the venture capitalist turned Hillbilly Elegy author turned GOP standard-bearer, has long opposed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In 2021, while running for Ohio senate, Vance told an Ohio news outlet that he did not support rape and incest exceptions in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s not whether a woman should be forced to bring a child to term,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/vance-abortion-rape/2021/09/24/c3007318-1d32-11ec-8380-5fbadbc43ef8_story.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he said}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s whether a child should be allowed to live, even though the circumstances of that child\u8217\'20\'19s birth are somehow inconvenient or a problem to the society.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But voters\u8217\'20\'19 outrage over the overturning of Roe v Wade has grown, leading \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters to a string of victories at the ballot box, and harnessing that outrage is widely considered Democrats\u8217\'20\'19 best hope for winning the November elections. As Trump and other Republicans have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/09/republican-abortion-ban-policy-platform-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tried to project}}}\uc2  a moderated stance on the issue \u8211\'20\'13 despite the fact that Trump handpicked three of the supreme court justices who overturned Roe \u8211\'20\'13 Vance has also tempered his public position.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have to accept that people do not want blanket \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans. They just don\u8217\'20\'19t,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/videos/politics/2023/12/10/sotu-vance-full-interview.cnn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance told CNN\u8217\'20\'19s Jake Tapper}}}\uc2  last year. \u8220\'20\'1CI say this as a person who wants to protect as many unborn babies as possible. We have to provide exceptions for the life of the mother and rape and so forth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In 2022, Vance said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/2022-midterm-elections-abortion-tim-ryan-biden-6b00b57614dff12903d4228e74c37ac8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he would support a national 15-week \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2  with exceptions. He also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/meet-the-press/video/gop-sen-jd-vance-says-he-supports-access-to-abortion-pill-mifepristone-214352965701"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told NBC News}}}\uc2  that he wants mifepristone, a common \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill that was at the heart of a major supreme court case this year, to remain accessible.\par \par \uc2 Even while supporting a national ban, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cincinnati.com/story/news/politics/elections/2022/10/12/ohio-senate-race-j-d-vance-discusses-economy-2020-election-opioids/69522502007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance has said}}}\uc2  he would like \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be \u8220\'20\'1Cprimarily a state issue\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COhio is going to want to have a different \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy from California, from New York, and I think that\u8217\'20\'19s reasonable,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CI want Ohio to be able to make its own decisions, and I want Ohio\u8217\'20\'19s elected legislators to make those decisions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But, he added: \u8220\'20\'1CI think it\u8217\'20\'19s fine to sort of set some minimum national standard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Much of Vance\u8217\'20\'19s public persona, however, remains defined by his support of what he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/elections/2022/08/24/ohio-senate-race-j-d-vance-focuses-on-conservative-family-issues/10204420002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sees as the traditional nuclear family}}}\uc2 . He has backed policies that he says will increase birth rates, such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wsBi3v2nntM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 making childbirth free}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jBrEng3xQYo&t=262s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said that people who are childfree}}}\uc2  by choice \u8220\'20\'1Cdo not have any physical commitment to the future of this country\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think the rejection of the American family is perhaps the most pernicious and the most evil thing that the left has done in this country,\u8221\'20\'1D said Vance, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.today.com/parents/parents/jd-vance-kids-rcna161977"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a father of three}}}\uc2 . He then went on to suggest that several Democratic politicians, like \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  and New Jersey senator \uc2 Cory Booker\uc2 , should not have political power because they do not have children.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhy have we let the Democrat party become controlled by people who don\u8217\'20\'19t have any children? And why is this just a normal fact of American life?\u8221\'20\'1D Vance asked. \u8220\'20\'1CThat the leaders of our country should be people who don\u8217\'20\'19t have a personal and direct stake in it via their own offspring, via their own children?\u8221\'20\'1D (The vice-president has two stepchildren.)\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMany of the most unhappy and most miserable and most angry people in our media are childless adults,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JDVance1/status/1437813365204729856"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance has also called people}}}\uc2  who fear having kids \u8220\'20\'1Ccat ladies\u8221\'20\'1D who \u8220\'20\'1Cmust be stopped\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JDVance1/status/1387763955557445640"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said that universal daycare}}}\uc2  is \u8220\'20\'1Cclass war against normal people\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Two days after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe, Vance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JDVance1/status/1541113407650336768"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CIf your worldview tells you that it\u8217\'20\'19s bad for women to become mothers but liberating for them to work 90 hours a week in a cubicle at the \uc2 New York Times\uc2  or \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 , you\u8217\'20\'19ve been had.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Shortly after Trump announced he had chosen Vance as his running mate, Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s campaign started to circulate a clip of comments Vance made in 2021 about violence in marriages.\par \par \uc2 JD Vance says women should stay in violent marriages \u8220\'20\'1Cfor the sake of their kids\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/zqM15Aqhvm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/zqM15Aqhvm}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Biden-Harris HQ (@BidenHQ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BidenHQ/status/1812936472095232385?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 15, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is one of the great tricks that I think the sexual revolution pulled on the American populace, which is the idea that, like: \u8216\'20\'18Well, OK, these marriages were fundamentally, you know, they were maybe even violent, but certainly they were unhappy. And so getting rid of them and making it easier for people to shift spouses like they change their underwear, that\u8217\'20\'19s going to make people happier in the long term,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vice.com/en/article/93abve/jd-vance-suggests-people-in-violent-marriages-shouldnt-get-divorced"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance said in response}}}\uc2  to a question on fatherlessness.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vice.com/en/article/93abve/jd-vance-suggests-people-in-violent-marriages-shouldnt-get-divorced"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vance has said}}}\uc2  that he was not defending men who commit domestic abuse and that he himself is a victim of domestic abuse.\par \par \uc2 Marjorie Dannenfelser, president of the powerful anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  group SBA Pro-Life America, praised Vance on Monday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHis ability to compellingly share these stories on a national stage will surely be an asset,\u8221\'20\'1D Dannenfelser said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CWith approximately 750,000 babies in states like California and New York still lacking basic protections, we need champions whose boldness will not waver.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240716ek7g001bk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
