\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Biden struggles to land lines as Trump lies in first presidential debate\b0\par\par\uc2 George Chidi in Atlanta \par \uc2 828 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2024\par 20:10 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 President and ex-president spar over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tax policy as CNN moderators fail to factcheck TrumpFour key takeaways from the debate\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden}}}\uc2  sparred over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tax policy in the first presidential debate in which the president struggled to land his lines and the former president repeatedly made false claims about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-capitol-breach"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 6}}}\uc2 , the national debt, and that he presided over the \u8220\'20\'1Cgreatest economy in the history of our country\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Biden described Trump as \u8220\'20\'1Cthe worst president in American history\u8221\'20\'1D, citing a consensus of historians. Trump responded by extolling the historic virtues of his tax cuts. \u8220\'20\'1CNobody has ever cut taxes like us. We cut taxes four times,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said.\par \par \uc2 Trump regularly answered straightforward questions \u8211\'20\'13 about the economy, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  or the opioid crisis \u8211\'20\'13 with non sequiturs about immigration or China. He also repeatedly spewed false claims about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the environment and the border. CNN moderators failed to factcheck Trump.\par \par \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s voice at times sounded raspy \u8211\'20\'13 the campaign said he has a cold \u8211\'20\'13 and he frequently struggled to complete his thoughts. During one notable moment early in the debate, Biden was laying into Trump over his tax policies and stumbled as he was running out of time to speak, before blurting out: \u8220\'20\'1CWe finally beat Medicare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 After the debate, commentators focused on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/27/biden-trump-debate-democrats-reaction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats\u8217\'20\'19 panic about Biden\u8217\'20\'19s performance}}}\uc2 , with several suggesting the party needs to consider nominating a different candidate at the convention in August. \u8220\'20\'1CThe biggest thing in this election is voters\u8217\'20\'19 concerns \u8211\'20\'13 and it\u8217\'20\'19s both swing voters and base voters \u8211\'20\'13 with his age, and those were compounded tonight,\u8221\'20\'1D Democratic strategist David Plouffe said on MSNBC.\par \par \uc2 Early in the debate, CNN moderator Dana Bash asked Trump about his position on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a post-Roe v Wade environment.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat I did was, I put three supreme court justices on the court and they killed Roe,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said. \u8220\'20\'1CRight now, the states control it, and that\u8217\'20\'19s the will of the people,\u8221\'20\'1D he added, noting that he favors exceptions to a ban. Biden defended Roe and legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and Trump responded by drawing the debate into a discussion of illegal immigration.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s comments about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rested on a lie popular with religious conservatives: that Democrats favor policy that allows for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  up until birth. He also falsely claimed that ending Roe v Wade protections was something \u8220\'20\'1Ceveryone wanted\u8221\'20\'1D, despite consistent polling that shows the public desires at least some access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  under the law.\par \par \uc2 And yet, Trump called Biden a liar presenting disinformation.\par \par \uc2 Trump argued that \u8220\'20\'1Cmillions of people\u8221\'20\'1D are coming across the border and receiving social security benefits \u8211\'20\'13 a claim without evidence. Trump also argued that the opioid problem could be traced to fentanyl manufacturing in China, smuggled into the US across the southern border.\par \par \uc2 Biden noted that he has a proposal to increase technology and staffing at the border that was rejected by Republicans in Congress at Trump\u8217\'20\'19s behest.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-elections-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US elections 2024}}}\uc2  : a guide to the first presidential debate\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Biden v Trump: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/28/biden-trump-first-presidential-debate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 90 miserable minutes}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Who won the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/28/trump-biden-debate-memes-social-media"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 meme wars}}}\uc2  ?\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s performance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/27/biden-trump-debate-democrats-reaction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sends Democrats into panic}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/28/who-could-replace-joe-biden-here-are-six-possibilities"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Six who could replace Biden}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Trump and Biden\u8217\'20\'19s claims \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/27/fact-check-debate-biden-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 factchecked}}}\par \par \uc2 The two candidates sharply differed in their memory and view of the war in Ukraine. Biden labeled \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  a war criminal who would extend the war in Ukraine to neighboring Nato states like Poland. Trump, however, called the Ukrainian president, \uc2 Volodymyr Zelenskiy\uc2 , the \u8220\'20\'1Cworld\u8217\'20\'19s greatest salesman\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Trump denied responsibility for the January 6 insurrection, instead arguing that then House speaker \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2  bears responsibility for turning down national guard troops \u8211\'20\'13 one of several questionable claims.\par \par \uc2 Biden met that claim with exasperation on his face, a constant in the debate. Trump turned a question about his search for \u8220\'20\'1Crevenge\u8221\'20\'1D into a diatribe about the president\u8217\'20\'19s son, \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The debate in Atlanta holds special significance to Black voters, both in the city where they are an important voting bloc in a swing state, and elsewhere. Biden said he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t blame Black Americans for being disappointed in the progress that has been made under his administration, but noted the historic gains made in employment, loan forgiveness and other measures that have come during the last four years.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s response was to remind voters that Biden described Black criminals as \u8220\'20\'1Csuperpredators\u8221\'20\'1D early in his political career.\par \par \uc2 Asked about social security, Biden argued that a tax on millionaires would keep the system solvent without hurting anyone making less than $400,000 a year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe idea that we don\u8217\'20\'19t need to protect seniors is ridiculous,\u8221\'20\'1D Biden said, touting the benefits of the Affordable Care Act.\par \par \uc2 Biden replied by describing Trump\u8217\'20\'19s affair with adult film actor Stormy Daniels while his wife Melania was pregnant, calling Trump a man with \u8220\'20\'1Cthe morals of an alley cat\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Trump denied sleeping with Daniels.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240628ek6s0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
