\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  unanimously upholds access to  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman in New York \par \uc2 1,036 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 June 2024\par 18:45 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 FDA\uc2  still has the power to give expanded access to mifepristone in major victory to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters\par \par \uc2 The availability of a common {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  pill will remain unchanged, the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruled on Thursday in a unanimous 9-0 decision, handing a major victory to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters who feared that the court that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  just two years ago would further hack away at access to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Conservative bloc\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Alito \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Barrett \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Gorsuch \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kavanaugh \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Roberts \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Thomas \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 Liberal bloc\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jackson \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Kagan \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Sotomayor \u8211\'20\'13 Majority\par \par \uc2 The case, a consolidation of Food and Drug Administration v Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine and Danco Laboratories LLC v Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine, dealt with the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ability to regulate mifepristone, one of two drugs typically used in medication abortions, which now make up more than 60% of all US abortions and have become a major target of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists. A coalition of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents had tried to persuade the supreme court to roll back a series of moves by the \uc2 FDA\uc2  to expand access to the drug, such as allowing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers to mail mifepristone to patients \u8211\'20\'13 a request that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/mar/26/us-supreme-court-abortion-pill-case-mifepristone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the justices met with skepticism}}}\uc2  in the case\u8217\'20\'19s March arguments.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents claimed that, if the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s current regulations of mifepristone were allowed to remain, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doctors could suffer harm if they have to treat women who experience complications from mifepristone. But in Thursday\u8217\'20\'19s majority opinion, Justice \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2  rejected that argument, ruling that the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists did not prove that they had the legal right, or standing, to bring the case in the first place.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBecause the plaintiffs do not prescribe, manufacture, sell, or advertise mifepristone or sponsor a competing drug, the plaintiffs suffer no direct monetary injuries from \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s actions relaxing regulation of mifepristone,\u8221\'20\'1D Kavanaugh wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CNor do they suffer injuries to their property, or to the value of their property, from \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s actions. Because the plaintiffs do not use mifepristone, they obviously can suffer no physical injuries from \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s actions relaxing regulation of mifepristone.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The unanimous ruling marked a rare moment of consensus on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Only Justice \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2 , one of the most hardline conservative justices on the court, wrote a concurring opinion that dealt primarily with the legal nuances of standing, arguing that so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cabortionists\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 a term widely seen as derogatory among \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers \u8211\'20\'13 should also lack standing to sue on behalf of their patients.\par \par \uc2 Rightwing judges have long complained that it is too easy for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers to challenge restrictions on the procedure, according to Mary Ziegler, a professor at the \uc2 University of California, Davis\uc2 , who studies the legal history of reproduction. But given the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s 6-3 conservative majority, she said \u8220\'20\'1Cno \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  provider in their right mind is going to be spending a lot of time trying to litigate to get to the supreme court now\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Members of Congress hailed the decision. \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a massive victory for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access, but there is no question \u8211\'20\'13 we must codify access to reproductive care nationwide,\u8221\'20\'1D Representative \uc2 Pramila Jayapal\uc2 , a Democrat from Washington, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RepJayapal/status/1801257705195131179"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted on X}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis challenge to mifepristone was meritless from the start. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication is safe and effective,\u8221\'20\'1D Senator Elizabeth Warren, a Massachusetts Democrat, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/SenWarren/status/1801260630202007915"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added on X}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CMake no mistake: \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and Republican politicians will not stop marching us toward a nationwide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. We must protect reproductive freedom everywhere.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Although the ruling did please \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights activists, many had similar reactions to Warren.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re relieved that the supreme court recognized this sham case for what it is, but this baseless push to block \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access should never have been heard by them in the first place,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Mini Timmaraju\uc2 , CEO and president of \uc2 Reproductive Freedom for All\uc2 , said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need court reform to salvage the legitimacy of our federal judiciary \u8211\'20\'13 and we won\u8217\'20\'19t stop fighting for it until it\u8217\'20\'19s a reality.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Given that the outcome of the case rested on standing, there is a chance that other plaintiffs may continue challenging access to mifepristone. Three states have already joined the case as plaintiffs at a lower-court level. If \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  wins the presidency in November, he may also try to restrict access to mifepristone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/13/supreme-court-abortion-pill-mifepristone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 through a 19th-century anti-obscenity law}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The supreme court has also not yet ruled on its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2024/apr/24/us-supreme-court-abortion-rights-emtala"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  case from this term}}}\uc2 , which deals with a federal law that mandates that hospitals stabilize the health of patients who show up at their emergency rooms with medical emergencies. The Biden administration and the state of Idaho have clashed over whether this law {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/23/supreme-court-verdict-emergency-abortions-patients-doctors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 requires doctors to perform emergency abortions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday\u8217\'20\'19s decision does not change the fact that the fight for reproductive freedom continues. It does not change the fact that the supreme court overturned Roe v Wade two years ago, and women lost a fundamental freedom,\u8221\'20\'1D Joe Biden said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CIt does not change the fact that the right for a woman to get the treatment she needs is imperiled if not impossible in many states.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The president, as he has repeatedly done from his re-election campaign trail, called on Congress to codify Roe\u8217\'20\'19s protections into law.\par \par \uc2 Had the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents won, the ruling could have had consequences for every medication regulated by the \uc2 FDA\uc2 , including other kinds of politicized drugs such as vaccines, HIV medications and drugs used in gender-affirming healthcare.\par \par \uc2 Danco Laboratories, a manufacturer of mifepristone and a petitioner in the case, applauded Thursday\u8217\'20\'19s opinion, which reversed and remanded a ruling from the fifth circuit court of appeals that would have rolled back the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s efforts to expand mifepristone access.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBy rejecting the fifth circuit\u8217\'20\'19s radical, unprecedented and unsupportable interpretation of who has standing to sue, the justices reaffirmed longstanding basic principles of administrative law,\u8221\'20\'1D Abigail Long, an executive at Danco, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CIn doing so, they maintained the stability of the \uc2 FDA\uc2  drug approval process, which is based on the agency\u8217\'20\'19s expertise and on which patients, healthcare providers and the US pharmaceutical industry rely.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240613ek6d00235\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
