\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: \uc2 Hamas\uc2  official says nobody knows how many hostages are still alive\b0\par\par\uc2 Vivian Ho \par \uc2 1,167 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 June 2024\par 11:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Hamas\uc2  spokesperson says Israeli tanks have advanced on Rafah. Plus: Scotland\u8217\'20\'19s burgeoning seaweed industry\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 With the safe return of the hostages crucial to any deal for a ceasefire, a senior \uc2 Hamas\uc2  official has said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/14/no-idea-how-many-israeli-hostages-alive-hamas-official"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Cno one has an idea\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  how many of the 120 remaining hostages in Gaza are alive.\par \par \uc2 Reiterating \uc2 Hamas\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s position on the US-supported ceasefire proposal, now backed by a \uc2 UN\uc2  security council resolution, spokesperson and political bureau member Osama Hamdan {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/2024/06/13/middleeast/hamas-interview-israel-gaza-hostages-intl/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told CNN}}}\uc2  the group \u8220\'20\'1Cneeded a clear position from Israel to accept the ceasefire, a complete withdrawal from Gaza, and let the Palestinians to determine their future by themselves.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What is happening in Gaza? Israeli tanks advanced into the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/13/israel-gaza-war-rafah"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 western part of Rafah on Thursday}}}\uc2  as the city came under intense helicopter, drone and artillery fire in what residents described as one of the worst bombardments of the area so far.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Are displaced Palestinians receiving aid? The \uc2 UN\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s relief agency for Palestinians, the largest aid organisation operating in Gaza, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/13/unrwa-israel-frequently-preventing-aid-deliveries-gaza"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accused Israeli authorities}}}\uc2  of frequently preventing it from delivering aid.\par \par \uc2 Trump makes first visit to the Capitol since January 6 attack\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  was met with applause and a serenade of \u8220\'20\'1CHappy Birthday\u8221\'20\'1D from Republicans in his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/13/trump-capitol-hill-republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first visit to the US Capitol}}}\uc2  following the January 6 attack in which his supporters descended on the building in an effort to overturn the 2020 presidential election result. \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2 , the Democratic former House speaker, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/13/nancy-pelosi-trump-capitol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 condemned Trump\u8217\'20\'19s visit}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday, the instigator of an insurrection is returning to the scene of the crime,\u8221\'20\'1D Pelosi said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CJanuary 6 was a crime against the Capitol, that saw Nazi and Confederate flags flying under the dome that Lincoln built.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  unanimously upholds access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruled on Thursday in a unanimous 9-0 decision to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/jun/13/supreme-court-abortion-pill-access"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 uphold access to the \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pill mifepristone }}}\uc2  in a major victory to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters \u8211\'20\'13 and a rare moment of consensus on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re relieved that the supreme court recognized this sham case for what it is, but this baseless push to block \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access should never have been heard by them in the first place,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Mini Timmaraju\uc2 , the CEO and president of \uc2 Reproductive Freedom for All\uc2 , said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need court reform to salvage the legitimacy of our federal judiciary \u8211\'20\'13 and we won\u8217\'20\'19t stop fighting for it until it\u8217\'20\'19s a reality.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The US and South Korea have warned \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  against forging closer military ties with North Korea amid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/14/vladimir-putin-north-korea-visit-us-south-korea-ukraine-war-weapons"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signs of preparations for a possible parade}}}\uc2  in Kim Il-sung Square. A civilian aircraft was cleared from Pyongyang\u8217\'20\'19s airport.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2  shareholders approved a $45bn (\u163\'00\'A335.3bn) pay deal for CEO \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/jun/13/tesla-shareholders-approve-elon-musk-pay"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest executive pay package at a US-listed firm}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A prominent #MeToo journalist in China was sentenced to five years in jail alongside a labor activist who was sentenced to three and a half years, almost 1,000 days after they were detained on allegations of inciting state subversion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/14/sophia-huang-xueqin-prominent-china-metoo-journalist-sentenced-jail-five-years-supporters-say"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to supporters}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Jailed American reporter \uc2 Evan Gershkovich\uc2  will soon stand trial in Russia more than a year after his arrest on espionage charges that he, his employer, and the White House have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/13/wsj-journalist-evan-gershkovich-trial-russia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decried as politically motivated}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Dozens of hikers have reported falling ill during trips to a popular waterfall near Grand Canyon national park, with some saying they {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/14/grand-canyon-havasupai-waterfalls-hikers-illness"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vomited and others saying they had a fever.}}}\par \par \uc2 Stat of the day: Taiwan\u8217\'20\'19s declining birthrate is forcing schools to close\par \par \uc2 Taiwan is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/14/taiwan-birthrate-decline-schools-close-population"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 struggling to achieve the \u8220\'20\'1Creplacement birthrate\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  of 2.1 babies per woman needed to maintain a stable population \u8211\'20\'13 a number Taiwan hasn\u8217\'20\'19t hit since the mid-1980s. In 2023, the rate was 0.865. The declining birthrate is leading to school closures: 15 colleges and universities have closed since 2014, and four of Taiwan\u8217\'20\'19s 103 private universities have also been ordered to close.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: Afghan teenage girls on life without school\par \par \uc2 It has been more than 1,000 days since the \uc2 Taliban\uc2  declared schools only for boys. An estimated 1.2 million teenage girls are now banned from secondary schools in Afghanistan. Without school, many of these girls were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/article/2024/jun/14/nobody-is-coming-to-help-us-afghan-teenage-girls-on-life-without-school"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forced into early marriage}}}\uc2  and are now suffering through domestic violence, suicide, drug addiction and an eradication from all aspects of public life.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen I told [her parents] about my studies and dreams, they laughed and said: \u8216\'20\'18Since the \uc2 Taliban\uc2  has come, girls will never be allowed to study. It\u8217\'20\'19s better to get on with your life and get married,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D one girl said. \u8220\'20\'1C[After the wedding], my husband\u8217\'20\'19s family told me, \u8216\'20\'18We bought you and paid for you, we didn\u8217\'20\'19t get you for free. So you should be at home and working for us.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8230\'20\'26 or this: Pigeons on the pill\par \par \uc2 Trials are under way in the UK and Europe to get {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/article/2024/jun/14/wildlife-pest-invasive-species-control-contraceptives-squirrels-pigeons-boars"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 contraceptives into pigeons}}}\uc2 , wild boar and grey squirrels \u8211\'20\'13 species that have been deemed as invasive or pests. Researchers are looking to fill special feeders and bait boxes with hazelnut spreads and grains laced with contraceptives, believing this to be a more humane and effective way of controlling populations that have previously been poisoned, shot or trapped.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe don\u8217\'20\'19t have many alternatives to lethal control. That\u8217\'20\'19s where fertility control really could be a great opportunity to manage these things,\u8221\'20\'1D said Prof Steve Belmain, an ecologist from \uc2 Greenwich University\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Climate check:\par \par \uc2 Scotland\u8217\'20\'19s burgeoning seaweed industry\par \par \uc2 Seaweed forests absorb carbon dioxide from seawater and the atmosphere, acting as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/article/2024/jun/13/kelp-help-how-scotlands-seaweed-growers-are-aiming-to-revolutionise-what-we-buy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vital buffer against the climate crisis}}}\uc2 . In Scotland, a burgeoning seaweed industry is working to revolutionize the future of the planet with farmed kelp, which can be used to produce plastic substitutes, beauty products and food supplements.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSeaweed has everything it needs \u8211\'20\'13 no fertilisers, pesticide or land required. We just leave it to grow and while it\u8217\'20\'19s growing it\u8217\'20\'19s also providing a habitat for fish \u8211\'20\'13 and it\u8217\'20\'19s cleaning the water of harmful heavy metals,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kyla Orr, of KelpCrofters.\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: The \u8216\'20\'18inside out\u8217\'20\'19 of Amy Poehler\par \par \uc2 Ahead of the release of \uc2 Pixar\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Inside Out 2, in which she voices the character Joy, Amy Poehler {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/article/2024/jun/14/amy-poehler-interview-inside-out-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spoke to the Guardian}}}\uc2  about emotions, parenting and youth. \u8220\'20\'1CThe way that that [the younger] generation is curious about their own identity is really powerful,\u8221\'20\'1D she said, with vim. \u8220\'20\'1CDon\u8217\'20\'19t stop investigating yourself! The trap we all fall into is thinking we\u8217\'20\'19re cooked. It\u8217\'20\'19s not like you turn a certain age and you say: \u8216\'20\'18There! I\u8217\'20\'19ve got it. I know who I am!\u8217\'20\'19 It never ends.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sign up\par \par \uc2 First Thing is delivered to thousands of inboxes every weekday. If you\u8217\'20\'19re not already signed up, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/info/2018/sep/17/guardian-us-morning-briefing-sign-up-to-stay-informed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 subscribe now}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Get in touch\par \par \uc2 If you have any questions or comments about any of our newsletters please email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:newsletters@theguardian.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newsletters@theguardian.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240614ek6e001gx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
