\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Arizona supreme court delays enforcement of 1864  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban\b0\par\par\uc2 Gloria Oladipo \par \uc2 442 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 May 2024\par 14:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Court grants motion to stay enforcement of near-total ban for 90 days as Democratic attorney general weighs next steps\par \par \uc2 The Arizona supreme court on Monday granted a motion to stay the enforcement of an 1864 law that bans almost all abortions, a win for reproductive rights activists in the swing state.\par \par \uc2 The state\u8217\'20\'19s highest court agreed to the Arizona attorney general Kris Mayes\u8217\'20\'19s request for a 90-day delay of the near-total ban, further pushing back enforcement of the 1864 legislation after a repeal of the ban was passed earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 The stay will last until 12 August. A separate court case on the legislation which granted an additional 45-day stay means the law cannot be enforced until 26 September, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.azag.gov/press-release/attorney-general-mayes-issues-statement-arizona-supreme-court-ruling-granting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mayes said in a statement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am grateful that the Arizona supreme court has stayed enforcement of the 1864 law and granted our motion to stay the mandate in this case for another 90 days,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 Mayes added that her office is weighing the \u8220\'20\'1Cbest legal course of action\u8221\'20\'1D, including a petition to the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The latest decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/02/arizona-1864-abortion-ban-repealed-governor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comes two weeks}}}\uc2  after the Democratic Arizona governor, \uc2 Katie Hobbs\uc2 , signed a law to repeal the ban.\par \par \uc2 But the most recent repeal can only take place 90 days after the Arizona legislative session ends, possibly allowing for a small window when the ban could be enforced.\par \par \uc2 Last year\u8217\'20\'19s session ended on 31 July, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/arizona-supreme-court-pushes-back-enforcement-1864-abortion-ban-rcna152092"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NBC News reported}}}\uc2 . If lawmakers adhere to that timeline, the ban could be in effect for approximately a month, until late October.\par \par \uc2 Hobbs has said that she will not prosecute any medical practitioners under the 1864 law.\par \par \uc2 The Arizona supreme court rejected a motion from Planned Parenthood Arizona on Monday to hold off on enforcing the 1864 ban until the repeal takes effect.\par \par \uc2 On the latest court ruling, the reproductive health organization vowed to continue fighting to \u8220\'20\'1C[ensure] all Arizonans can access the care they need in a safe, caring environment\u8221\'20\'1D, according to a statement.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe will not be intimidated or silenced by anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  extremists, because our bodies and our autonomy are at stake.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In Arizona, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently banned after 15 weeks of pregnancy. The 1864 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law bans nearly all abortions, except to save a woman\u8217\'20\'19s life. The US civil war-era law does not make exceptions for rape or incest.\par \par \uc2 Residents of the swing state {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/arizona-abortion-rights-amendment-backers-says-gathered-signatures-nee-rcna145922"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will probably}}}\uc2  vote on a referendum on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  come November after a coalition of reproductive rights organizations collected enough signatures to get the issue on the 2024 ballot.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240514ek5e0020c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
