\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  restrictions tied to higher rates of intimate partner homicide, says study\b0\par\par\uc2 Jessica Glenza \par \uc2 587 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 May 2024\par 18:55 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 For each of the five studied \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions, risk of intimate partner homicide increased by 3.4% in new study\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.healthaffairs.org/doi/abs/10.1377/hlthaff.2023.01098#:~:text=Using%20robust%20difference%2Din%2Ddifferences,related%20homicide%20in%20this%20population."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new study}}}\uc2  finds {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  restrictions may be associated with increased rates of intimate partner homicide among reproductive-aged women and girls.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the study looks at the period before the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned the national right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2022, when states could restrict \u8211\'20\'13 but not outlaw \u8211\'20\'13 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Fourteen states have since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2023/nov/10/state-abortion-laws-us#:~:text=Since%20Roe%20was%20overturned%20in,referendums%20to%20protect%20abortion%20rights."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 banned the procedure}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As a result, the dynamics identified in the research may in fact be significantly exacerbated, even if they are not yet reflected in the data.\par \par \uc2 Even though intimate partner homicide is relatively rare, \u8220\'20\'1Cit is consistently among the leading causes of death in pregnant and postpartum people,\u8221\'20\'1D said Maeve Wallace, an associate professor at Tulane University in Louisiana, and a reproductive and perinatal epidemiologist who led the study. The report was published as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.healthaffairs.org/doi/abs/10.1377/hlthaff.2023.01098#:~:text=Using%20robust%20difference%2Din%2Ddifferences,related%20homicide%20in%20this%20population."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 research letter}}}\uc2  in the journal Health Affairs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/02/cost-banning-abortion-financial-emotional-comic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Other studies}}}\uc2  have found that women and girls often seek abortions to leave abusive relationships or avoid bringing children into abusive relationships.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn thinking about pregnancy itself as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nichd.nih.gov/newsroom/news/091622-pregnancy-associated-homicide#:~:text=In%202018%20and%202019%2C%20pregnant,of%20the%20COVID%2D19%20pandemic."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risk factor for homicide}}}\uc2 , it follows that the ability to prevent or end a pregnancy\u8221\'20\'1D could have \u8220\'20\'1Cimmediate implications\u8221\'20\'1D for women\u8217\'20\'19s safety, said Wallace.\par \par \uc2 Researchers conducted the study by looking at five separate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions \u8211\'20\'13 all laws designed to restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access without improving patient safety \u8211\'20\'13 and the rates reported in the National Violent Death Reporting System maintained by the \uc2 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention\uc2  (CDC).\par \par \uc2 The authors of the study then controlled for a variety of factors known to affect the rate of intimate partner violence \u8211\'20\'13 including income inequality, gun ownership and even party control of the state legislature.\par \par \uc2 Researchers also expanded the typical definition of \u8220\'20\'1Creproductive-aged\u8221\'20\'1D to include girls as young as 10. They did this based on case reports of girls as young as 13 experiencing intimate or familial violence and analyzed the years 2014 to 2020, which represents the most recent available data.\par \par \uc2 For each of the five studied \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions, the rate of intimate partner homicide among girls and women ages 10 to 44 years old increased 3.4%, researches found. Extrapolated across the US, that finding could indicate an additional 24 women and girls died of intimate partner homicide during the years covered by the study. The research follows other studies which found Trap restrictions \u8211\'20\'13 measures that regulate where abortions may be provided and performed \u8211\'20\'13 are also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/dec/28/women-restricted-abortion-access-higher-suicide-risk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 associated with increased risk of suicide}}}\uc2  among reproductive-aged women.\par \par \uc2 Not every state was included in the analysis. Researchers only included states where 100% of localities reported to the violent deaths database. That ruled out three of the most populous and diverse states in the US \u8211\'20\'13 California, Florida and Texas. In total, the analysis captured about 52% of girls and women ages 10 to 44 living in the US.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, because there were very few identified cases of homicide among pregnant and postpartum women, girls and women of reproductive age were effectively a proxy measure for likely pregnant or postpartum victims of violence.\par \par \uc2 Wallace said the research is almost certainly an underestimate of the potential risk to pregnant and postpartum women, because intimate partner violence is generally underreported.\par \par \uc2 Intimate partner homicide is \u8220\'20\'1Cthe super extreme relatively rare outcome\u8221\'20\'1D, said Wallace. However, an estimated 41% of women in the US have experienced intimate partner violence, making \u8220\'20\'1Cthe burden \u8230\'20\'26 huge\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240507ek57002xq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
