\par\par \uc2 Books\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18We must not stop\u8217\'20\'19: potential Trump VP Ben Carson touts national  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 808 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2024\par 17:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 In new book, retired neurosurgeon and former housing secretary emphasises extreme stance at odds even with Trump himself\par \par \uc2 In a new book, the retired {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/lifestyle/style/the-story-of-the-surgery-that-made-ben-carson-famous--and-its-complicated-aftermath/2015/11/13/15b5f900-88c1-11e5-be39-0034bb576eee_story.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 neurosurgeon}}}\uc2 , former US {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2018/feb/28/ben-carson-housing-department-furniture-inquiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 housing secretary}}}\uc2  and potential Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/21/trump-vp-pick-shortlist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vice-presidential pick}}}\uc2  Ben Carson calls for a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban \u8211\'20\'13 a posture at odds with most Americans and even \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  himself.\par \par \uc2 Hailing the 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.oyez.org/cases/2021/19-1392"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs v Jackson}}}\uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruling that removed the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Carson writes: \u8220\'20\'1CWe must not stop there \u8230\'20\'26 the battle over the lives of unborn children is not yet finished. Many states have made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  illegal because of the Dobbs decision, yet the practice continues in many more states.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat is needed is legislation that guarantees the right to life for all American citizens, including those still in the womb. Therefore, we must be boldly vocal about saving our fellow human beings through the legislative process. They are counting on us!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Carson\u8217\'20\'19s book, The Perilous Fight: Overcoming Our Culture\u8217\'20\'19s War on the American Family, will be published later this month. \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  obtained a copy.\par \par \uc2 With the book, Carson follows other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/21/trump-vp-pick-shortlist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 potential Trump running mates}}}\uc2  in seeking to sell himself to the reading and voting public as well as the former president, among them the extremist congresswoman {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2023/nov/15/marjorie-taylor-greene-book-january-6-mtg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Marjorie Taylor Greene}}}\uc2  ; the former Democrat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2024/apr/23/tulsi-gabbard-repeats-false-hillary-clinton-grooming-claim"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tulsi Gabbard}}}\uc2  ; and the South Dakota governor and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2024/apr/26/trump-kristi-noem-shot-dog-and-goat-book"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 self-confessed}}}\uc2  dog- and goat-killer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/02/kristi-noem-response-dog-killing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kristi Noem}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 No 2 to Trump may be a dubious prize \u8211\'20\'13 his vice-president, \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 , ended up running for his life from Trump supporters who wanted to hang him on January 6 \u8211\'20\'13 but contenders continue to jostle.\par \par \uc2 Recent reporting suggests Carson has slipped from the front rank. On Thursday, \uc2 Bloomberg{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/nancook/status/1786082434993274983"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Trump was closely considering \uc2 Doug Burgum\uc2 , the governor of North Dakota, and three senators: \uc2 Marco Rubio\uc2  of Florida, JD Vance of Ohio and Tim Scott of South Carolina.\par \par \uc2 But Carson, 72, remains close to Trump, having challenged him for the Republican nomination in 2016 \u8211\'20\'13 briefly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2016/mar/04/ben-carson-ends-republican-presidential-campaign"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leading}}}\uc2  the race \u8211\'20\'13 before becoming one of the only members of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s cabinet to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2019/03/08/hud-secretary-ben-carson-im-not-leaving-i-will-resign-or-maybe-stay/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stay}}}\uc2  throughout his term, even after Trump incited the deadly January 6 attack on Congress.\par \par \uc2 Carson\u8217\'20\'19s hardline views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  are well known: during his 2016 run he ran into controversy when he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-politics/wp/2015/10/25/ben-carson-likens-abortion-to-slavery-wants-to-see-roe-v-wade-overturned/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 likened}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slavery and said he wanted to see the end of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.oyez.org/cases/1971/70-18"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 , the 1973 ruling which safeguarded the federal right.\par \par \uc2 His new book comes nearly two years after Roe was brought down by a supreme court to which Trump appointed three rightwing justices.\par \par \uc2 Carson writes: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m grateful that in my lifetime I was able to hear these incredible words established by the supreme court of the United States: \u8220\'20\'1CHeld, the constitution does not confer a right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ; Roe and Casey are overruled; and the authority to regulate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is returned to the people and their elected representatives.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.oyez.org/cases/1991/91-744"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Planned Parenthood v Casey}}}\uc2  was a 1992 case that upheld Roe. Thirty years later, tilted 6-3 to the right by Trump, the court brought both rulings down.\par \par \uc2 Carson continues: \u8220\'20\'1CThe supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s decision in Dobbs v Jackson was a crucial correction to the error of Roe v Wade, and I am certainly grateful for that correction. However, we must not stop there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Many observers suggest Republicans should have stopped their attacks on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights before achieving their goal with the fall of Roe.\par \par \uc2 Public opinion remains in favour of legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.gallup.com/poll/321143/americans-stand-abortion.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to Gallup, just 13% of Americans agree with Carson that it should be banned entirely.\par \par \uc2 Since Dobbs, fueled by such voter sentiment, Democrats have enjoyed electoral victories, even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/03/kansas-abortion-vote-state-constitution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in Republican-run states}}}\uc2 , when campaigning on Republican threats to women\u8217\'20\'19s reproductive rights. The issue has been placed front and centre of the presidential election to come by the Biden campaign.\par \par \uc2 Extreme developments among the states have included the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/may/01/florida-six-week-abortion-ban-takes-effect"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduction}}}\uc2  of a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban in Florida and in Arizona the triggering (and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/02/arizona-1864-abortion-ban-repealed-governor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 repeal}}}\uc2  ) of a brutal ban {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/02/arizona-1864-abortion-ban-repealed-governor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 passed in 1864}}}\uc2 , before statehood and when the age of consent there was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://azcapitoltimes.com/news/2024/04/16/abortion-law-from-an-age-when-child-molestation-was-legal-inter-racial-marriage-illegal/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 just 10}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Trump has struggled to reconcile {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/12/donald-trump-abortion-roe-v-wade-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boasts about bringing down Roe}}}\uc2  with avoiding talk of a national ban.\par \par \uc2 Last month, the former president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/08/trump-abortion-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CStates will determine by vote or legislation, or perhaps both. Whatever they decide must be the law of the land, or in this case the law of the state.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMany states will be different, many will have a different number of weeks, some will be more conservative than others. At the end of the day this is all about the will of the people. You must follow your heart, or in many cases your religion or faith.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDo what\u8217\'20\'19s right for your family, and do what\u8217\'20\'19s right for yourself.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240503ek53001be\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
